WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:14.917
"Let go of me!"

2
00:00:15.217 --> 00:00:15.998
yelled Roxy.

3
00:00:16.898 --> 00:00:19.220
Four Professor Dittos dragged her down a hallway.

4
00:00:20.521 --> 00:00:21.862
Roxy kicked and squirmed.

5
00:00:25.804 --> 00:00:27.746
The professors pushed her into a dark room.

6
00:00:28.746 --> 00:00:30.688
Roxy heard a heavy door slam behind her.

7
00:00:35.724 --> 00:00:37.025
"Aargh!" Roxy stamped her foot.

8
00:00:37.705 --> 00:00:38.546
The walls shook.

9
00:00:39.486 --> 00:00:40.186
"Rocket Girl!"

10
00:00:40.487 --> 00:00:41.467
said a familiar voice.

11
00:00:42.348 --> 00:00:43.348
"What are you doing here?"

12
00:00:44.289 --> 00:00:45.770
Roxy peered into the darkness.

13
00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:47.411
"Mayor Bloom?"

14
00:00:47.771 --> 00:00:48.231
she said.

15
00:00:48.251 --> 00:00:52.073
"I came here to find you.

16
00:00:53.014 --> 00:00:56.055
Your assistant said you stole the playground money this morning."

17
00:00:57.796 --> 00:00:58.937
Mayor Bloom frowned.

18
00:00:58.957 --> 00:01:00.998
"I didn't steal any money.

19
00:01:01.979 --> 00:01:04.120
I never even got to City Hall this morning.

20
00:01:05.232 --> 00:01:06.773
I was kidnapped and brought here."

21
00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:09.274
Roxy was confused.

22
00:01:09.294 --> 00:01:13.917
"But your assistant saw you The mayor sighed.

23
00:01:14.757 --> 00:01:18.319
"She saw something that looked like me," he said.

24
00:01:18.339 --> 00:01:21.501
"Professor Ditto made a robot clone of me.

25
00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:23.682
And now I know why.

26
00:01:24.643 --> 00:01:26.724
He wanted my clone to steal that money!"

27
00:01:28.165 --> 00:01:28.905
Roxy gulped.

28
00:01:28.925 --> 00:01:33.208
"I think we have a bigger problem than stolen money, Mayor."

29
00:01:34.284 --> 00:01:35.025
"What do you mean?"

30
00:01:35.485 --> 00:01:36.306
asked Mayor Bloom.

31
00:01:36.326 --> 00:01:39.748
"Professor Ditto made a robot clone of me!"

32
00:01:40.149 --> 00:01:40.789
said Roxy.

33
00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:43.552
"Who knows what it will do?"

34
00:01:43.572 --> 00:01:45.613
"Oh no!"

35
00:01:46.034 --> 00:01:46.814
said Mayor Bloom.

36
00:01:46.834 --> 00:01:49.797
"It will have all of your super powers!

37
00:01:50.697 --> 00:01:51.698
You have to stop it!"

38
00:01:53.239 --> 00:01:53.980
Roxy nodded.

39
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.022
"Step back, Mayor.

40
00:01:56.862 --> 00:01:58.664
I'm going to blast us out of here."

41
00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:05.062
Detective Smith was speeding toward Metro City University.

42
00:02:06.123 --> 00:02:07.484
A call came in on his radio.

43
00:02:07.504 --> 00:02:10.807
"Detective," said the police dispatcher.

44
00:02:10.827 --> 00:02:14.650
"The Metro City Museum is being robbed!"

45
00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:18.894
"I'll be there as soon as I can," said Detective Smith.

46
00:02:18.914 --> 00:02:21.776
"First I have to catch up with Rocket Girl.

47
00:02:22.657 --> 00:02:25.439
She went to Metro City University to find Mayor Bloom."

48
00:02:25.459 --> 00:02:28.742
"No, she didn't," said the dispatcher.

49
00:02:28.762 --> 00:02:31.044
"Rocket Girl is at the museum."

50
00:02:32.188 --> 00:02:32.648
"She is?"

51
00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:33.989
asked Detective Smith.

52
00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:35.991
"What is she doing there?"

53
00:02:36.011 --> 00:02:39.893
"You're not going to believe this," said the dispatcher.

54
00:02:39.913 --> 00:02:43.196
"But Rocket Girl is the one robbing the museum!"

55
00:02:45.677 --> 00:02:47.238
Detective Smith scratched his head.

56
00:02:47.259 --> 00:02:50.060
"What is going on today?"

57
00:02:53.082 --> 00:02:55.524
A minute later Detective Smith arrived at the museum.

58
00:02:57.606 --> 00:03:00.748
The Rocket Girl robot clone was carrying a priceless vase.

59
00:03:01.844 --> 00:03:03.205
Detective Smith was stunned.

60
00:03:03.225 --> 00:03:04.946
"Rocket Girl!"

61
00:03:05.146 --> 00:03:05.666
he cried.

62
00:03:05.686 --> 00:03:07.347
"What are you doing?"

63
00:03:10.009 --> 00:03:13.330
Whiz-hoo! Lasers shot from the clone's eyes.

64
00:03:14.211 --> 00:03:15.291
Detective Smith ducked.

65
00:03:16.192 --> 00:03:18.913
Just then the real Roxy landed in front of the detective.

66
00:03:20.614 --> 00:03:22.115
The lasers bounced off her chest.

67
00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:25.557
Detective Smith looked at Roxy.

68
00:03:26.337 --> 00:03:28.138
He looked at the Rocket Girl robot clone.

69
00:03:29.139 --> 00:03:30.660
Detective Smith rubbed his eyes.

70
00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:33.407
"Two Rocket Girls?"
